        "message": "Optional browser-side rules with a separate hour limit per tracker hostname. Saving another tracker does not replace existing rules. Counts Transmission's cumulative seeding time, including seeding without upload traffic, not time since adding the torrent. The tracker's credited time may differ. Chrome must be running; the popup may be closed. Disabled by default."
