    "seedTimeLimitSafety": {
        "message": "Only completed seeding or seed-queued torrents are stopped; nothing is deleted. Every tracker on a torrent must have the selected hostname. Malformed or mixed-host tracker lists are skipped. Existing torrents are excluded unless explicitly included. Checks run at most once per minute, on normal polling; sleep and background scheduling may delay stopping. Manually restarting a limited torrent does not exempt it. Restored backups require reactivation."
    },
